  "description": "A strongly-typed .NET 8+ client for the Bancontact Pro Merchant APIs (Payment, Refund, Reconciliation) and its QR products (On a Display, On a Receipt, Static QR, Top Up, Invoice): per-product credentials, JWS-signed refund and reconciliation calls, JWKS-verified callbacks, QR payload URLs, and dependency injection registration.",
  "id": "BancontactPro.Net",
  "isPrerelease": true,
  "lastEdited": "2026-10-24T23:50:26.3Z",
